:1050,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_1080","layoutPosition":{"x":1080,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_1110","layoutPosition":{"x":1110,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_1140","layoutPosition":{"x":1140,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_1170","layoutPosition":{"x":1170,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_1200","layoutPosition":{"x":1200,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_1230","layoutPosition":{"x":1230,"y":240}},{"id":"bp_2100","layoutPosition":{"x":2100,"y":240}}],"schematicNotes":[{"id":"n_cavity_notes","text":"CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nEFI Main Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 6 / A28 - low-side (Aux 5-8 capable of either; low-side chosen for ECU Hold Power)\nEFI Main Relay 86: Coil + - PERMANENT battery via F12 5A (must stay live after key-off for Hold Power)\nETB Power Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 2 / A20 - LOW-SIDE ONLY (Aux 1-4)\nETB Power Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nFuel Pump Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 3 / A19 - LOW-SIDE ONLY (Aux 1-4)\nFuel Pump Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nRadiator Fan Relay (on/off) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nStart Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off) 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Ign 5 / B13 - low-side, NO internal flywheel diode - diode-suppressed relay required\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c7: A1 - Cabin Temp (source not yet wired - open item)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c15: S1 - Evap Core (source not yet wired - open item)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c16: S2 - AC Request (source not yet wired - open item)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c23: L1 low-side (spare \u2014 oil lamp channel TBD, see open items)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c24: L2 low-side (spare \u2014 oil lamp channel TBD, see open items)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c25: L3 low-side (spare \u2014 oil lamp channel TBD, see open items)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c26: L4 low-side (spare \u2014 oil lamp channel TBD, see open items)\nBulkhead A - firewall (HDP24-2 1: spare (size 16) - was the shared shield drain, retired by 6.32\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 1: Switched 12V - INJECTOR power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 2: Switched 12V - COP / ignition coil power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 14: MRS EPS pump logic enable (F13 7.5A, ignition-switched)\nSensor Gnd Out splice (wired o c1: Gnd Out sensor ground rail -> ECU-A A24 / ECU-B B22. Knock 1 SIG- lands here, NOT on A7. A7 is shield ground and carries drains only.\nSensor +5V splice (wired on B- 1: +5V Out rail sp_5v -> ECU-A A32, wired on ST185-B-ECU\nSensor +8V splice (wired on B- 1: +8V Out rail sp_8v -> ECU-A A6, wired on ST185-B-ECU","schematicPosition":{"x":4200,"y":0}}],"wireParts":[{"id":"wp_20_blk","partNumber":"EW-1C20-BLK","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, BLACK, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Black","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_blu","partNumber":"EW-1C20-BLU","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, BLUE, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Blue","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_brn","partNumber":"EW-1C20-BRN","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, BROWN, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Brown","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_grn","partNumber":"EW-1C20-GRN","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, GREEN, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Green","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_grn_yel","partNumber":"EW-1C20-GRN-YEL","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, GREEN/YELLOW, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Green","stripeColor":"Yellow","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"